    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread context for parallel execution. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each thread has a unique thread index, and can synchronize and communicate with other threads in the same shared context. <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structcyqlone_1_1parallel_1_1SharedContext" kindref="compound">SharedContext</ref> </para>
